# Project Documentation Rules

## README Updates
- Always update README.md when making changes to:
  - Project structure or architecture
  - Dependencies or requirements
  - Setup/installation steps
  - API endpoints or core functionality
  - Configuration options
- Suggest README updates when completing major features or refactors

## docs/app_spec.md Rules
- Always update docs/app_spec.md when making changes to:
  - Project strucutre or architecture
  - Dependencies or requirements
  - Database or model schemas
  - Configuration options
- Suggest docs/app_spec.md updates when completing major features or refactors

## CLAUDE.md
- Always update CLAUDE.md when making changes to:
  - Significant architectural or design changes
- Suggest CLAUDE.md updates when completing major features or refactors